<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.label>lance de insanidade psíquica</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It overwhelms the target's mind with terrifying perceptual distortions, driving them into a berserk state. There is a risk of brain damage. It has a long range, but requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Ela sobrecarrega a mente do alvo com terríveis distorções perceptuais, conduzindo-os para um estado berserk. Há um risco de danos cerebrais. Tem um longo alcance, mas requer linha de visão.</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em cooldown</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.label>lance de insanidade psíquica</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity immune -->
  <Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>insanidade psíquica imune</Apparel_PsychicInsanityLance.verbs.psychic_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.label>lance de choque psíquico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It shocks the target's mind with chaotic images, blocking coherent perception and dropping them into a state of psychic shock. There is a risk of brain damage. It has a long range, but requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Ele choca a mente do alvo com imagens caóticas, bloqueando a percepção coerente e deixá-los em um estado de choque psíquico. Há um risco de danos cerebrais. Tem um longo alcance, mas requer linha de visão.</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em cooldown</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock lance -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.label>lance de choque psíquico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock immune -->
  <Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>choque psíquico imunológico</Apparel_PsychicShockLance.verbs.psychic_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
</LanguageData>
